SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Faneromeni (by boat)
LOCATION:Faneromeni\, south Antiparos\, Antiparos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The whitewashed chapel of Panagia Faneromeni on the wild southern tip of Antiparos can only be reached by caique or a long dirt track\, and on 7-8 September the whole island goes out there for the Nativity of the Virgin with food and wine after the liturgy. Ask at the harbour a day or two ahead about boats leaving for the feast.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/antiparos/#faneromeni-south-antiparos-panigiri-of-panagia-faneromeni-by
